CloudBurrow patch 22 to github.com/goccy/bigquery-emulator v0.8.1
(cloudburrow/cloudburrow#1419).

The bug: jobs.list listed each job with only its reference, kind,
statistics, status and user, whatever the projection, where BigQuery's
projection=full "Includes all job data" (the enum's description in the
API's discovery document,
https://cloud.google.com/bigquery/docs/reference/rest/v2/jobs/list). So
CloudBurrow's front read each configuration it had not seen with a
jobs.get: 16.6 s for the first list of 5,000 jobs made by jobs.query
(measured through the front, 2026-10-16, arm64 kind node), which the
first unfiltered INFORMATION_SCHEMA.JOBS query after them waited for.

The patch lists each job with the configuration it keeps, the one
jobs.get answers, when the request asks for projection=full.

